49
00:03:47,279 --> 00:03:52,160
defensive situation that isn't as straightforward as holding a boxed in last with two obvious flanks.

50
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:56,000
When you're forced to fight in more open areas without much pressure from your team, Scout needs

51
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,679
to take some of that pressure off them by becoming the center of attention without just throwing his

