00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:28,480
valuable. If you still have space behind you to retreat into, use it. There's no reason to keep

57
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:32,720
testing an area your team no longer has any presence in, especially when you're on defense.

58
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:36,320
Your job isn't to take the space back by yourself, it's to stay alive,

59
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:41,200
continue slowing them down and keep running time off the clock, but you need to be alive to do this.

60
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:45,119
Where Blue Team is all about trying to get one big coordinated push to break through,

61
00:04:45,119 --> 00:04:46,880
Red is more about survivability.

62
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:57,359
The previous clip was a good example of what Scout should be doing when his team doesn't

