position yourself, which fights you take, and whether you are actually where your team needs

78
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:23,040
you. High ground is still important, but only if it's actually safe. Most of the obvious high

79
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:27,839
ground on the first section of Dustbowl leaves you exposed to snipers and spam. Sometimes you

